Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.31,0:00:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're early, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.33,0:00:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.29,0:00:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scare all your customers away?
