Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.69,0:00:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but first check this out: a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.71,0:00:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an MMO for the AmuSphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.19,0:00:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what replaced nerve\Ngear on the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.41,0:00:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, so it's a VR MMO just.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.85,0:00:53.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like sword art.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.76,0:00:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alfheim online?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.13,0:00:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, actually, it's pronounced Alfheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.43,0:01:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it means
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.25,0:01:03.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,land of the fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.29,0:01:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fairies, huh?
