Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.25,0:02:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Land of the Fairies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like a cute game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.57,0:02:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's not what I hear, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.49,0:02:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For one, PKing's allowed, and it's\Ngot this hardcore skill system.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.21,0:02:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, hardcore?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.99,0:02:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, the game's not\Nlevel-based, it's skill-based.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta use your skills\Nover and over to improve them,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and combat depends on your\Nreal-life physical abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.53,0:03:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is hardcore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.21,0:03:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no sword skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.51,0:03:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Other than that, it's like SAO with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:15.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I hear, people are going nuts for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.45,0:03:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because in the game, you feel\Nlike you're flying. Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.31,0:03:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know how fairies have wings?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.59,0:03:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the game's got\Nthis flight engine thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.07,0:03:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once you figure it out, you can fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.37,0:03:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.47,0:03:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's a player controlling?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.23,0:03:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No idea, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.73,0:03:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do hear it's a pain\Nto get used to, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.65,0:03:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you supposed to control\Nsomething you don't have?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:41.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you have to use the\Nmuscles in your back. Ahem!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.19,0:03:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, getting back to Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.61,0:03:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does she have to do with this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.97,0:03:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.55,0:03:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like Asuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.53,0:03:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kinda figured you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.51,0:03:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you cut the crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:04:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is this?
