Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the top of that, there's\Nthis legendary castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.27,0:04:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Players are
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.41,0:04:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,divided up into nine races.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.85,0:04:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each one of those races is trying to\Nbe the first to get to the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.27,0:04:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't they just fly up to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's already been tried, but\Nthe game's got a limit to how
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long you can stay airborne.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.95,0:04:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.05,0:04:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These five players stacked up,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.89,0:04:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bigger players on the\Nbottom they tried launching
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.99,0:04:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,themselves like a rocket\Ngood idea it's insane but
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.93,0:04:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kind of clever yeah well\Nthose cats didn't even make
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it past the lowest branch\Nthey did manage to snap
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.51,0:04:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a couple shots though\Nwhen they checked out the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.57,0:04:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pics they saw something\Nweird a birdcage you could
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,call it that and after\Nzooming in on it as far as
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.99,0:04:59.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they could they saw her okay\Nbut if it's really Asuna,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.49,0:05:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what's she doing there?
