Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.57,0:05:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrecked progress?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.35,0:05:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without getting into specifics,\Nyou could say I'm the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.65,0:05:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,keeping Asuna alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Agil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.49,0:05:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I borrow this for a couple days?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.93,0:05:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.43,0:05:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You thinking about going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I gotta check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.33,0:05:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A game where it's okay to die\Nshouldn't be that big a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.51,0:05:33.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, I still gotta buy\Nthe hardware for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.11,0:05:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's compatible with what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.27,0:05:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The AmuSphere is just a NerveGear\Nrig, but with better security.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.57,0:05:40.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.25,0:05:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The battle's not over till it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.81,0:05:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You feel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.23,0:05:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a route and come back safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.23,0:05:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.14,0:05:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when I do, let's all meet up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God, what am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.29,0:06:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so stupid! Hey, I'm back. Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.33,0:06:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.43,0:06:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I, I thought I was gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.13,0:06:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a spaz.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.65,0:06:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those muffins aren't going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sugu, about last night. Yeah? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.81,0:06:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.91,0:06:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.37,0:06:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, Sugu, I feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:54.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, I can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.81,0:06:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll get Asuna back no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.65,0:07:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.11,0:07:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to getting\Nthe chance to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.73,0:07:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you do, I'm sure you'll hit it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.19,0:07:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'd better get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.27,0:07:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're having the ceremony here on january\N26th a week from now save the date
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.97,0:07:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i need your help again one more time
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.03,0:07:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blink, start!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.47,0:08:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Alpine Online.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.95,0:08:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please enter your gender and the\Nname you wish to be identified as.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're THE Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.49,0:08:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a hero. It's an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.95,0:08:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are nine races of\Nfairies to choose from.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.21,0:08:34.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please select which race\Nyou wish to play as.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.43,0:08:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.71,0:08:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have selected Spriggan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.03,0:08:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your character's appearance\Nwill be decided at random.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you wish to continue?
