Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.97,0:08:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will now be Teleport to your\Nhometown in Spriggan territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.37,0:08:55.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, player.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.19,0:09:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.69,0:09:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agh!
