Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.09,0:10:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm back in another game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.83,0:10:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after everything I just went through.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.97,0:10:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.93,0:10:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is. Thank God.
