Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.19,0:10:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, please don't be a bug.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:39.30,0:10:41.26,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\fay0.04\fs117\blur1.5\an4\frx4\move(810,960,810,-90)\frz15.28\c&H8C8B87&}Skills\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}One-handed Sword\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100} \N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Blade Throw\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Weapon Defense\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Battle Healing\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Scout\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100\fay0.02}Track\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Hide\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Night Vision\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Inventory Expansion\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Sprint
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.30,0:10:41.26,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\fay0.04\fs117\blur1.05\an4\frx4\move(813,963,813,-87)\frz15.28\c&HDADCD3&}Skills\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}One-handed Sword\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100} \N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Blade Throw\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Weapon Defense\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Battle Healing\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Scout\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100\fay0.02}Track\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Hide\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Night Vision\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Inventory Expansion\N{\fscy25}\N{\fscy100}Sprint
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.45,0:10:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all my skills and stats from SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.47,0:10:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.73,0:10:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I back inside SAO?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.37,0:11:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.09,0:11:03.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.39,0:11:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:50.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.17,0:11:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember you, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yui
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.77,0:12:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.09,0:12:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:08.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what about breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.95,0:12:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.86,0:12:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.99,0:12:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.91,0:12:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.74,0:12:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.99,0:12:24.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.31,0:12:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy. Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.97,0:12:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.35,0:12:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.69,0:12:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.67,0:12:50.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, do you know where you are\Nor what's going on? Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.71,0:12:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, we're not in SAO anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.89,0:12:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a totally different game now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.53,0:12:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called Alfheim Online.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.77,0:13:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need a few seconds to assess it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.03,0:13:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what I can tell, this world has been\Ncopied from the Sword Art Online servers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.65,0:13:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.83,0:13:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The engine, programming, and\Ngraphics format are exactly the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Cardinal system needs updating, but\Nthat's the only thing that sticks out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.49,0:13:22.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.40,0:13:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That makes sense, because Argus\Nwas the company running SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.31,0:13:27.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They folded and Wreck took over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.73,0:13:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.64,0:13:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and if Wreck's already got all of Argus'\Ntechnology, it figures they ported over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.41,0:13:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, when I checked I still had\Nmy old skills and stats. Strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.25,0:13:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take a look at your\Ndata and see what I find.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.19,0:13:44.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.89,0:13:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the same character data\Nyou used when you were in SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.71,0:13:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The formatting for saved\Ndata is almost identical.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever skills you had that were similar\Nin both games were ported over and merged.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.79,0:14:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's why my\Ndual-wielding skill's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.81,0:14:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your items seem to be lost, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.57,0:14:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might want to delete them before the\Nerror detection program finds out about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.23,0:14:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I better.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.10,0:14:17.56,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75\fax0.01\fs52.5\pos(615.75,351.3)\frz2.6\c&HE5E2E1&}Do you want to delete all your items?
