Dialogue: 2,0:14:24.02,0:14:25.65,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.2\fax0.01\fs52.5\pos(612.6,349.8)\frz2.6\c&H7C7B78&}Do you want to delete all your items?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.65,0:14:25.69,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\blur0.75\fax0.01\fs52.5\pos(690.75,346.8)\frz2.6\c&HE5E2E1&}Do you want to delete all your items?
Dialogue: 2,0:14:25.65,0:14:25.69,Menus,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80\blur1.2\fax0.01\fs52.5\pos(687.6,345.3)\frz2.6\c&H7C7B78&}Do you want to delete all your items?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.75,0:14:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, what am I going to\Ndo about my skill level?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.75,0:14:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one else can see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.33,0:14:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, no one except the Game Master, and\Nas long as he doesn't, you should be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.25,0:14:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, I guess I'm not a beater anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a plain old cheater now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.61,0:14:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you being\Nidentified by the system?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.95,0:14:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's classifying me as a\Nplayer support program.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the world of the game,\NI'm a navigation pixie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.05,0:14:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.93,0:15:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what I look like as a pixie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.67,0:15:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.89,0:15:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Daddy, that's annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had admin privileges in SAO.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.57,0:15:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you still have them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.63,0:15:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.54,0:15:22.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the system will only\Nallow me to access the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wide area maps and the reference database.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.63,0:15:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.47,0:15:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think your mommy might be stuck\Nin here somewhere. Mommy? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.61,0:15:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean she's stuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.81,0:15:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After SAO was cleared, Asuna\Nnever woke up in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.21,0:15:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found out she was seen in Alfheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a picture, but\Nit's too blurry to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:52.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I got a pretty good\Nidea where she might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.05,0:15:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's something called the World Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.75,0:15:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.07,0:15:59.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy's there? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.03,0:16:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.45,0:16:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to start the game\Nin a town in Spriggan territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.35,0:16:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how come I ended up here\Nin this forest instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.81,0:16:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your location data may be corrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.63,0:16:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps there was some interference?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either way,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.08,0:16:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would have been nice if the game dropped\Nme a little closer to the world tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.93,0:16:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.77,0:16:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, these are my wings, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.09,0:16:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I fly with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.69,0:16:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to access your controller first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.29,0:16:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise your left hand, then position your\Nfingers like you're grabbing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.29,0:16:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull it toward yourself to elevate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.51,0:16:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Push it away to descend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.63,0:16:51.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and move it left or right to turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.67,0:16:58.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold down the button to accelerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To decelerate, just\Nease up on it a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.67,0:17:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as your wings are\Nshining, you can stay airborne.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.99,0:17:10.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you can't fly forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.25,0:17:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After a while, you'll\Nneed to rest your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.49,0:17:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.73,0:17:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I've got it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.09,0:17:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do me a favor, scan the map and\Nsee where the nearest town is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.87,0:17:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one in Sylph\Nterritory, west of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.53,0:17:31.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a town called Sylvain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.27,0:17:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the closest one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.75,0:17:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are other players near here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.15,0:17:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.89,0:17:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weepa!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.01,0:18:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up, Recon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.59,0:18:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little further and we'll\Nbe in Sylph territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.07,0:18:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out, Recon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, they never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.39,0:18:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.53,0:18:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.91,0:18:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.27,0:18:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sigurd and the others\Nare already there by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.15,0:18:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep these guys busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.93,0:18:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You try to knock one of them down, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.33,0:18:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.37,0:18:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me how useful you can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.83,0:19:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.29,0:19:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot! Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.15,0:19:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Recon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.87,0:19:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.33,0:19:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're on a mission, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.27,0:19:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give up your money and\Nitems, and we'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.13,0:19:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you acting like such\Na gentleman for, Kagemune?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.05,0:19:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we haven't fought\Na chick in forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.55,0:19:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's waste her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.29,0:20:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, try it, but I'm\Ntaking one of you with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.73,0:20:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever's not afraid of dying,\Ncome on, step up and get some.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.17,0:20:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a stubborn girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.17,0:20:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.43,0:20:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, gotta work on those landings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.63,0:20:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Go! Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.79,0:20:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would someone tell me why three big\Nguys are fighting one single girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.83,0:20:55.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's pretty uncool if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.09,0:20:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.31,0:20:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better get your ass out\Nof here, noob. Fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.43,0:21:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.01,0:21:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get ready to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.59,0:21:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.65,0:21:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.63,0:21:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.23,0:21:27.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hate to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.59,0:21:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mind if I take care of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.09,0:21:32.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, I guess if you really want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.05,0:21:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like they were gonna let\Nyou walk out of here alive anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.87,0:21:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then sit back and let me at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.05,0:21:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap. He disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.23,0:22:04.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, who's next?
